translate italian jamiep5_386a9d47:

    # gnd "Hm, getting into the deep questions now?"
    gnd "Hm, stiamo già entrando nelle domande profonde?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieConversation/jamiep5.rpy:16
translate italian jamiep5_68b7f918:

    # gnd "I guess I want the fairytale dream."
    gnd "Credo di volere il sogno da favola."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieConversation/jamiep5.rpy:17
translate italian jamiep5_c161b7d2:

    # gnd "I want a loving relationship."
    gnd "Voglio una relazione d’amore."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieConversation/jamiep5.rpy:18
translate italian jamiep5_84a44c5c:

    # gnd "I want to get married to my soulmate."
    gnd "Voglio sposarmi con la mia anima gemella."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieConversation/jamiep5.rpy:19
translate italian jamiep5_14b32e30:

    # gnd "I want at least three children."
    gnd "Voglio almeno tre figli."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieConversation/jamiep5.rpy:20
translate italian jamiep5_70863928:

    # gnd "I want to see them grow up and have their own children."
    gnd "Voglio vederli crescere e avere figli a loro volta."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieConversation/jamiep5.rpy:21
translate italian jamiep5_4499c8f0:

    # gnd "I want to spend my life surrounded by people that I love."
    gnd "Voglio passare la mia vita circondata dalle persone che amo."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieConversation/jamiep5.rpy:25
translate italian jamiep5_1d72f29a:

    # gnd "Yeah, I think so."
    gnd "Sì, penso di sì."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieConversation/jamiep5.rpy:27
translate italian jamiep5_cf38cad8:

    # gnd "Step one is finding that soulmate."
    gnd "Il primo passo è trovare quell’anima gemella."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieConversation/jamiep5.rpy:28
translate italian jamiep5_9aedfa0b:

    # gnd "I think I'm getting closer."
    gnd "Penso di esserci quasi."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieConversation/jamiep5.rpy:29
translate italian jamiep5_ae871f39:

    # pc "Oh yeah?"
    pc "Ah sì?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieConversation/jamiep5.rpy:30
translate italian jamiep5_4e948d93:

    # gnd "Yeah."
    gnd "Sì."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieConversation/jamiep5.rpy:33
translate italian jamiep5_8f56c3e9:

    # gnd "Why?"
    gnd "Perché?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieConversation/jamiep5.rpy:34
translate italian jamiep5_87af0849:

    # pc "Surrounding yourself with people you love is just asking for heartache."
    pc "Circondarti di persone che ami significa solo andare incontro a sofferenze."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieConversation/jamiep5.rpy:35
translate italian jamiep5_40d7d404:

    # pc "People get sick. People die."
    pc "Le persone si ammalano. Le persone muoiono."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieConversation/jamiep5.rpy:36
translate italian jamiep5_2b5ce695:

    # pc "The more people you love, the more people who can hurt you."
    pc "Più persone ami, più persone possono ferirti."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieConversation/jamiep5.rpy:37
translate italian jamiep5_a709efd5:

    # gnd "Wow, that's a pretty sad way to look at things."
    gnd "Wow, è un modo piuttosto triste di vedere le cose."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieConversation/jamiep5.rpy:38
translate italian jamiep5_a8099acc:

    # gnd "Yeah people die. Yeah it hurts. But you can't just not love anybody."
    gnd "Sì, le persone muoiono. Sì, fa male. Ma non puoi semplicemente non amare nessuno."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieConversation/jamiep5.rpy:39
translate italian jamiep5_a1226e3d:

    # gnd "My mom died. Your mom died. Would you rather you had never known them? Would that have been better?"
    gnd "Mia mamma è morta. Tua mamma è morta. Avresti preferito non averle mai conosciute? Sarebbe stato meglio?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieConversation/jamiep5.rpy:43
translate italian jamiep5_51c8d1d1:

    # gnd "THAT is ridiculous."
    gnd "QUESTO è ridicolo."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieConversation/jamiep5.rpy:44
translate italian jamiep5_38f2044e:

    # gnd "I know I'm happy to have been able to spend the time with my mom that I did."
    gnd "So di essere felice di aver potuto trascorrere il tempo che ho trascorso con mia mamma."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieConversation/jamiep5.rpy:45
translate italian jamiep5_61004df2:

    # gnd "I'm sad that she's gone now, but I'm so, SO happy for the time we had."
    gnd "Sono triste che ora non ci sia più, ma sono così, COSÌ felice per il tempo che abbiamo passato insieme."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieConversation/jamiep5.rpy:46
translate italian jamiep5_a11012e3:

    # gnd "I can't believe that you would feel differently about your mom."
    gnd "Non riesco a credere che tu possa provare qualcosa di diverso nei confronti di tua mamma."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieConversation/jamiep5.rpy:48
translate italian jamiep5_d3e8663d:

    # gnd "Right."
    gnd "Giusto."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieConversation/jamiep5.rpy:49
translate italian jamiep5_38f2044e_1:

    # gnd "I know I'm happy to have been able to spend the time with my mom that I did."
    gnd "So che sono felice di aver potuto passare il tempo che ho passato con mia mamma."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieConversation/jamiep5.rpy:50
translate italian jamiep5_61004df2_1:

    # gnd "I'm sad that she's gone now, but I'm so, SO happy for the time we had."
    gnd "Mi dispiace che ora non ci sia più, ma sono davvero, DAVVERO felice per il tempo che abbiamo trascorso insieme."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieConversation/jamiep5.rpy:51
translate italian jamiep5_2daa69ee:

    # gnd "Let's talk about something else before I get too upset."
    gnd "Parliamo di qualcos’altro prima che mi commuova troppo."

